                                "sense_id": "0f52ae19-5070-3895-81bd-35fed566a1a1",
                                "text": "Ye need not be so closehanded of anything I send you: ye may communicate them to whom ye will, for I am little concerned if they be published under others' name or not."
                            },
                            {
